WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club


00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:11.221
A major
turning point in my life


00:00:11.245 --> 00:00:14.226
was when I stopped
being afraid of dying.


00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:18.694
I used to think that I was my body.


00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:21.531
But if I looked deeper,


00:00:21.555 --> 00:00:24.536
my body is made
up of trillions of cells.


00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:27.704
And if I keep looking deeper,


00:00:27.728 --> 00:00:30.299
it's made up of trillions of atoms.


00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:33.169
And what are the atoms made up of?


00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:34.738
Nothing.


00:00:37.137 --> 00:00:40.383
They're just Whirlpools
in a sea of energy,


00:00:40.407 --> 00:00:42.387
and those aren't things at all.


00:00:44.611 --> 00:00:49.492
Science tells me virtually every
cell in my body has been replaced,


00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:51.723
but Foster's been here all along.


00:00:52.653 --> 00:00:56.165
So my essential
nature by definition,


00:00:56.189 --> 00:00:57.634
by logic,


00:00:57.658 --> 00:00:59.638
must be metaphysical.


00:01:02.329 --> 00:01:04.340
So if I'm metaphysical,


00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:10.315
who says that I die when my
physical body tires out and goes away.


00:01:17.477 --> 00:01:20.356
That's not only an
intellectual understanding.


00:01:20.414 --> 00:01:22.292
For me, it was an experience


00:01:22.316 --> 00:01:26.362
that I'm actually an
antenna in a field of energy,


00:01:26.386 --> 00:01:28.498
tapping guidance from it


00:01:28.522 --> 00:01:31.100
and then bringing
that into this body


00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:34.264
and into this physical
world to fulfill my purpose.


00:01:35.862 --> 00:01:38.841
This is where science and spirit,


00:01:38.865 --> 00:01:41.210
physics and metaphysics,


00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:42.579
all came together


00:01:42.603 --> 00:01:46.115
and fueled my journey of
exploring the innovations


00:01:46.139 --> 00:01:49.643
and the technologies that
reflect this understanding.


00:01:53.814 --> 00:01:57.193
This blending
of science and metaphysics


00:01:57.217 --> 00:02:00.763
has been a key topic
in our lives for years.


00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:03.566
It's based on an
understanding of energy,


00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:06.799
how it moves and
interacts in the cosmos.


00:02:07.561 --> 00:02:12.208
I believe this interactive
web of organized energy


00:02:12.232 --> 00:02:16.512
is exactly what Albert Einstein
was seeking but never found:


00:02:16.536 --> 00:02:18.379
the Unified Field.


00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:28.482
A universal fabric of
energy that connects all life.


00:02:33.453 --> 00:02:38.234
The scientific story we've
lived with for the past 300 years,


00:02:38.258 --> 00:02:40.703
based largely on the
theories of Isaac Newton,


00:02:40.727 --> 00:02:43.139
has changed radically.


00:02:43.163 --> 00:02:46.376
Newton's universe
operated like a machine


00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:51.681
with discrete matter moving through
a vast emptiness of space and time


00:02:51.705 --> 00:02:54.652
with a separate human
brain observing it.


00:02:57.344 --> 00:03:00.590
Looking at our cosmos
as a connected field


00:03:00.614 --> 00:03:04.827
requires that we reconsider all
that we've perceived as separate,


00:03:04.851 --> 00:03:06.763
which is essentially everything.


00:03:09.856 --> 00:03:12.835
As we come to understand
this web of energy


00:03:12.859 --> 00:03:15.838
and how to relate
to it harmoniously,


00:03:15.862 --> 00:03:21.177
we will finally have a way
for all life on planet Earth


00:03:21.201 --> 00:03:22.942
not just to survive,


00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:25.511
but to thrive.


00:03:31.778 --> 00:03:33.856
I'm Kimberly Carter Gamble.


00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:36.359
And I'm Foster Gamble.


00:03:36.383 --> 00:03:37.627
In 2011,


00:03:37.651 --> 00:03:41.861
Kimberly and I launched a film called
Thrive: What on Earth Will It Take?


00:03:42.322 --> 00:03:45.535
The film has been
translated into 27 languages


00:03:45.559 --> 00:03:48.631
and is now one of the most widely
viewed documentaries in history.


00:03:49.396 --> 00:03:52.408
We connected the dots among
seemingly disparate subjects


00:03:52.432 --> 00:03:54.410
from an ancient cosmic code


00:03:54.434 --> 00:03:56.345
to cutting-edge physics,


00:03:56.369 --> 00:03:58.848
from rigged banking
and political schemes


00:03:58.872 --> 00:04:01.384
to the suppression of new energy,


00:04:01.408 --> 00:04:04.252
holistic healing and UFO phenomena.


00:04:05.378 --> 00:04:08.991
We unpacked what's in
the way of humanity thriving


00:04:09.015 --> 00:04:13.327
and solution strategies for correcting
the dangerous mess we're in.


00:04:14.454 --> 00:04:17.567
The patterns we highlighted
are even more relevant


00:04:17.591 --> 00:04:20.595
in the wake of the global
response to COVID-19.


00:04:21.628 --> 00:04:23.473
After the movie came out,


00:04:23.497 --> 00:04:27.643
we heard from over a thousand
innovators from all over the world:


00:04:27.667 --> 00:04:32.415
scientists, inventors, medical
doctors and researchers


00:04:32.439 --> 00:04:36.785
who told us about their
technologies, inventions and insights.


00:04:36.843 --> 00:04:40.623
They claimed they had
technologies that could do everything


00:04:40.647 --> 00:04:44.460
from cure cancer to
access free energy.


00:04:44.484 --> 00:04:48.765
Clean abundant electricity
sourced straight from space.


00:04:48.789 --> 00:04:50.933
We knew they wouldn't
all be legitimate,


00:04:50.957 --> 00:04:54.604
but we also knew that if just
a few were what they claimed,


00:04:54.628 --> 00:04:57.907
it could completely
transform our world.


00:04:57.931 --> 00:05:01.878
So we put together teams
of engineers and doctors


00:05:01.902 --> 00:05:04.781
and other experts
to travel with us to


00:05:04.805 --> 00:05:05.815
Africa,


00:05:05.839 --> 00:05:07.049
China,


00:05:07.073 --> 00:05:08.347
Thailand,


00:05:08.408 --> 00:05:12.655
Egypt, all through
Europe, Costa Rica, Mexico


00:05:12.679 --> 00:05:16.526
and all over the United
States to find out what they had.


00:05:16.550 --> 00:05:20.429
Our attention shifted
from possibilities to results.


00:05:20.453 --> 00:05:22.865
We weren't looking to
make a sequel to Thrive,


00:05:22.889 --> 00:05:26.335
but the breakthroughs
we saw were so profound


00:05:26.359 --> 00:05:29.568
that we knew we had to get this
information out for others to see.


00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:32.875
With a gorgeous abundant planet,


00:05:32.899 --> 00:05:35.004
fundamentally good people


00:05:35.702 --> 00:05:38.581
and advanced technology,


00:05:38.605 --> 00:05:40.915
why are we in such
a lethal predicament?


00:05:41.441 --> 00:05:44.754
Is there something that
we're not aware of yet,


00:05:44.778 --> 00:05:49.525
the knowing of which would actually
transform the quality of life on earth


00:05:49.549 --> 00:05:51.358
and have us thriving?


00:05:51.885 --> 00:05:53.362
Let's find out.


00:06:18.845 --> 00:06:21.858
There's a huge
change that happens in civilization


00:06:21.882 --> 00:06:25.795
when they finally understand
that there's a fundamental field


00:06:25.819 --> 00:06:27.129
that they're bathing in


00:06:27.153 --> 00:06:29.394
and that they can access it.


00:06:30.590 --> 00:06:32.435
This Unified Field


00:06:32.459 --> 00:06:35.104
can begin to explain where does
the energy of a magnet come from,


00:06:35.128 --> 00:06:37.907
where does the energy
of a nuclei of an atom


00:06:37.931 --> 00:06:40.910
that's spinning it near the
speed of light in perpetuity.


00:06:40.934 --> 00:06:42.572
Where does that energy come from?


00:06:43.703 --> 00:06:46.616
I believe that we're very,
very close to a true unified theory


00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:51.487
that is backed by consistent,
relatable mathematics.


00:06:52.479 --> 00:06:54.824
And we've been trying
very hard for a longtime


00:06:54.848 --> 00:06:56.826
to define matter
by studying matter.


00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:58.961
The characteristics of
matter, the electron count,


00:06:58.985 --> 00:07:00.630
the proton count,
the neutron count.


00:07:00.654 --> 00:07:02.999
All those things kind
of come together.


00:07:03.023 --> 00:07:05.134
But what if the answer,
the simple answer,


00:07:05.158 --> 00:07:07.604
is by understanding
fully the vacuum.


00:07:28.448 --> 00:07:30.760
I've been studying
the Unified Field


00:07:30.784 --> 00:07:33.663
and the phenomenon of
accessing energy from it


00:07:33.687 --> 00:07:35.428
<i>for more than 30 years.</i>


00:07:35.855 --> 00:07:37.698
And since 1997,


00:07:37.757 --> 00:07:41.864
I've collaborated with cosmologist
