him proven wrong.


00:08:01.114 --> 00:08:02.959
The space between you and I


00:08:02.983 --> 00:08:05.995
and the space between
everything appears to be empty.


00:08:06.019 --> 00:08:08.164
We call it empty space commonly.


00:08:08.188 --> 00:08:09.496
But it's not.


00:08:09.923 --> 00:08:15.538
Space-time at a very specific
scale of the Planck length


00:08:15.562 --> 00:08:19.942
is quantized with spherical
units of Planck oscillators,


00:08:19.966 --> 00:08:22.776
billions of times
smaller than the atom.


00:08:24.137 --> 00:08:26.916
You can think of it as like a fluid


00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:29.546
that permeates all space.


00:08:32.812 --> 00:08:34.890
It's a source of the
gravitational field.


00:08:34.914 --> 00:08:36.826
It's a source of the
electromagnetic field.


00:08:36.850 --> 00:08:39.831
It's a source of mass.
It's the source of charge.


00:08:41.154 --> 00:08:44.266
So now we're starting to really
understand the mechanics of it


00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:45.633
at the deeper level.


00:08:47.027 --> 00:08:53.034
What is possible is
extracting energy from the ubiquium.


00:08:53.767 --> 00:08:54.944
It's all here. It's right here.


00:08:54.968 --> 00:08:56.245
That energy is here.


00:08:56.269 --> 00:08:59.807
We're not violating any
Second Law of Thermodynamics.


00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:03.619
We believe that the background
energy of everything around us


00:09:03.643 --> 00:09:04.687
is full of power.


00:09:04.711 --> 00:09:06.088
And in a very, very small area,


00:09:06.146 --> 00:09:09.923
