our society for thousands of years.


00:09:11.151 --> 00:09:15.131
I believe that
the new level of physics,


00:09:15.155 --> 00:09:19.201
the new level of technology
that's emerging in the world,


00:09:19.225 --> 00:09:23.672
that's extracting energy
from the fundamental field,


00:09:23.696 --> 00:09:30.579
are technologies that are finding
a way to create a resonance link


00:09:30.603 --> 00:09:32.640
to this fundamental field.


00:09:35.241 --> 00:09:37.820
I call the primary technology


00:09:37.844 --> 00:09:41.657
that I am developing to
achieve gravity control


00:09:41.681 --> 00:09:42.716
the resonator.


00:09:44.717 --> 00:09:47.897
It is an instrument
that's attempting


00:09:47.921 --> 00:09:51.634
to achieve high level
of resonance coupling


00:09:51.658 --> 00:09:56.107
to the fundamental quantum
field that's at the source of reality.


00:09:58.031 --> 00:10:00.309
Though the device
is not finished yet,


00:10:00.333 --> 00:10:03.879
I think that they're working
with the most advanced concept


00:10:03.903 --> 00:10:07.016
for accessing free energy
from the Unified Field


00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.077
that I've ever seen or heard of.


00:10:12.679 --> 00:10:15.624
This device
is built out of two coils


00:10:15.648 --> 00:10:21.163
that produces a magnetic field in
the geometry of a double torus shape


00:10:21.187 --> 00:10:27.203
and then it spins that
field in coordinated rotation


00:10:27.227 --> 00:10:32.108
to create this singularity that,
hopefully, couples to the vacuum


00:10:32.132 --> 00:10:35.773
and that's what we believe
it does to space-time.


00:10:37.971 --> 00:10:42.017
Inside the coil is a crystal
container, which is spherical,


00:10:42.041 --> 00:10:43.986
that has plasma in it,


00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:47.890
and the plasma is forced to rotate


00:10:47.914 --> 00:10:50.226
with the electromagnetic
field structure


00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:52.196
as we power up the coil.


00:10:52.952 --> 00:10:58.868
So we're basically making
a little star inside a crystal ball.


00:11:00.126 --> 00:11:05.808
The idea is that eventually
we can start the field geometry


00:11:05.832 --> 00:11:08.777
in the plasma
inside the crystal ball,


00:11:08.801 --> 00:11:10.379
and get it rotating


00:11:10.403 --> 00:11:12.047
and when it's self-sustaining,


00:11:12.071 --> 00:11:14.049
open the coil, remove that,


00:11:14.073 --> 00:11:16.952
that becomes a
self-sustaining device


00:11:16.976 --> 00:11:22.791
that can be running a spaceship
or your car or your house


00:11:22.815 --> 00:11:24.795
while making you healthy.


00:11:27.187 --> 00:11:32.701
Basically mimic what the
universe does when it builds a star


00:11:32.725 --> 00:11:34.796
or when it builds a galaxy.


00:11:42.168 --> 00:11:44.079
The next step for humanity,


00:11:44.103 --> 00:11:46.215
the next step in our evolution,


00:11:46.239 --> 00:11:50.719
I really believe, is to understand
gravity at a deeper level


00:11:50.743 --> 00:11:51.954
and learn to control it


00:11:51.978 --> 00:11:56.225
so that we can birth our
civilization into a space civilization,


00:11:56.249 --> 00:11:59.461
into a space colony; we
can explore our solar system,


00:11:59.485 --> 00:12:02.932
we can explore our galaxy,
and maybe even beyond.


00:12:03.957 --> 00:12:08.929
To me, resonance represents
the new world that is emerging.


00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:13.209
Given how centralized energy
can be used


00:12:13.233 --> 00:12:15.844
to manipulate and control people,


00:12:15.868 --> 00:12:19.915
and the dangerous and dirty ways
corporations are extracting energy,


00:12:19.939 --> 00:12:23.409
we've been highly
motivated to find alternatives.


00:12:24.344 --> 00:12:27.223
All the promising
technologies we heard about


00:12:27.247 --> 00:12:30.159
were based on a
common understanding


00:12:30.183 --> 00:12:33.028
that not only is everything energy,


00:12:33.052 --> 00:12:36.298
but that energy is always moving.


00:12:36.322 --> 00:12:39.301
That movement is called vibration


00:12:39.325 --> 00:12:43.831
and frequency is the
rate at which it's vibrating.


00:12:48.067 --> 00:12:51.046
When frequencies match in intensity,


00:12:51.070 --> 00:12:53.482
we get what's called resonance.


00:12:55.441 --> 00:12:57.453
We experience it as harmony.


00:12:57.477 --> 00:12:59.888
It sounds good and it feels good.


00:13:07.453 --> 00:13:09.832
According to quantum physics,


00:13:09.856 --> 00:13:12.768
the Field is geometric in design


00:13:12.792 --> 00:13:16.171
and woven into
predictable patterns.


00:13:17.163 --> 00:13:21.477
It unifies what are traditionally
considered separate forces


00:13:21.501 --> 00:13:25.847
and the organizing
principles apply at every scale.


00:13:28.374 --> 00:13:32.421
The inventors we met were all
operating on the understanding


00:13:32.445 --> 00:13:35.517
that the vacuum is not empty,


00:13:36.916 --> 00:13:40.896
<i>and that stillness is not still.</i>


00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:45.926
It's a dynamic of
absolute balanced energy.


00:13:52.365 --> 00:13:55.244
When we bring together
all the new discoveries,


00:13:55.268 --> 00:13:58.080
when we take into consideration
what they're telling us,


00:13:58.104 --> 00:14:02.885
it strongly suggests the
existence of a geometric pattern.


00:14:02.909 --> 00:14:07.089
So when we see energy
moving through this Field,


00:14:07.113 --> 00:14:09.525
the energy is not
moving haphazardly.


00:14:09.549 --> 00:14:12.594
It is following preferred pathways


00:14:12.618 --> 00:14:17.294
defined by the geometry
of the Field itself.


00:14:20.426 --> 00:14:24.006
Geometry is not
just points, lines and planes


00:14:24.030 --> 00:14:25.974
like I learned in school.


00:14:25.998 --> 00:14:30.846
It's about the push-pull
relationship of energetic systems


00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:35.084
like the pull between
the Earth and the Sun - gravity;


00:14:35.108 --> 00:14:38.419
and the push out
from the Sun - radiation.


00:14:39.512 --> 00:14:44.052
Pushing and pulling are
essentially geometric phenomena,


00:14:44.117 --> 00:14:48.430
and lines and planes are just
our conceptual representations


00:14:48.454 --> 00:14:50.024
of those dynamics.


00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:55.204
It's the predictability of
this push and pull dynamic


00:14:55.228 --> 00:15:00.175
that allows the inventors to
create replicable technologies.


00:15:00.199 --> 00:15:03.946
The geometry is all
based on energy moving


00:15:03.970 --> 00:15:07.645
and the shape of that
movement is the torus.


00:15:08.941 --> 00:15:14.254
All of the projects reporting the
best results were toroidal in design.


00:15:15.481 --> 00:15:19.561
This is because the
torus is the basic pattern


00:15:19.585 --> 00:15:24.299
that energy takes
throughout the entire cosmos.


00:15:24.323 --> 00:15:27.469
The torus looks like a doughnut.


00:15:27.493 --> 00:15:30.372
The energy flows
in through one end,


00:15:30.396 --> 00:15:32.608
circulates around the center


00:15:32.632 --> 00:15:35.010
and exits out the other end.


00:15:35.501 --> 00:15:38.213
Like a whirlpool in a stream,


00:15:38.237 --> 00:15:41.450
it's made from the
medium in which it exists


00:15:41.474 --> 00:15:44.546
and is at the same
time discrete within it.


00:15:45.011 --> 00:15:48.424
It's both distinct and unified,


00:15:48.448 --> 00:15:52.995
and demonstrates why something could
appear separate from something else,


00:15:53.019 --> 00:15:54.463
and from the Field,


00:15:54.487 --> 00:15:57.399
while still being connected to it.


00:15:57.423 --> 00:16:01.064
It's self-sustaining
at every scale.


00:16:02.195 --> 00:16:04.640
Picture the eye of a hurricane.


00:16:04.664 --> 00:16:09.340
<i>At the center of every
torus is a point of stillness.</i>


00:16:09.735 --> 00:16:13.382
The Field is basically
a sea of toruses,


00:16:13.406 --> 00:16:17.052
each one touching its
12 identical neighbors,


00:16:17.076 --> 00:16:18.714
like a stack of oranges.


00:16:20.546 --> 00:16:24.693
Connecting the center,
or still-point, of each torus


00:16:24.717 --> 00:16:27.095
with its nearest neighbors


00:16:27.119 --> 00:16:32.728
reveals equal, non-physical
lines of force, or vectors.


00:16:34.193 --> 00:16:38.574
It's what visionary inventor
and futurist, Buckminster Fuller,


00:16:38.598 --> 00:16:41.176
called the Vector Equilibrium.


00:16:53.379 --> 00:16:59.528
When this balanced state of equilibrium
is extended without boundaries,


00:16:59.552 --> 00:17:03.565
it reveals that infinite
fabric of space-time


00:17:03.589 --> 00:17:06.502
that Fuller called the IVM,


00:17:06.526 --> 00:17:09.438
or the Isotropic Vector Matrix.


00:17:09.462 --> 00:17:12.272
It just means the
same in all directions.


00:17:13.032 --> 00:17:16.745
This is the web of life
force that the inventors say


00:17:16.769 --> 00:17:21.116
is the source of the
energy that they're tapping.


00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:26.556
Life as we know it arises
through contraction and expansion,


00:17:28.314 --> 00:17:30.385
pulling and pushing.


00:17:31.183 --> 00:17:34.062
It finds stability in symmetries.


00:17:34.554 --> 00:17:35.760
Six-fold.


00:17:38.824 --> 00:17:40.326
Five-fold.


00:17:43.462 --> 00:17:44.668
Four-fold.


00:17:46.832 --> 00:17:48.368
Three-fold.


00:17:50.803 --> 00:17:56.485
This pulsation of energy is what
Bucky Fuller called the jitterbug:


00:17:56.509 --> 00:17:59.388
the dance of the cosmos.


00:17:59.412 --> 00:18:03.625
Fuller humbly noted on
his poster that this dynamic


00:18:03.649 --> 00:18:08.223
may come to be identified
as the Unified Field.


00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:14.469
So what is the
Unified Field unifying?


00:18:14.493 --> 00:18:18.168
