00:55:57.821 --> 00:56:00.066
But we do get what we tolerate.


00:56:00.090 --> 00:56:02.435
You see, if everyone got
what they dream about,


00:56:02.459 --> 00:56:05.338
then everyone's dreams would
instantly be here right now.


00:56:05.362 --> 00:56:08.441
But we do receive
our minimum standard.


00:56:08.465 --> 00:56:09.609
That's a guarantee.


00:56:09.633 --> 00:56:12.445
So when I'm working with
people, I'm always asking them,


00:56:12.469 --> 00:56:13.813
What's your dream?
What's your vision?


00:56:13.837 --> 00:56:15.114
And we're connecting with that,


00:56:15.138 --> 00:56:18.585
but then we're looking at
'What is your current reality?"


00:56:18.609 --> 00:56:22.488
Because your current
reality is a direct reflection


00:56:22.512 --> 00:56:25.789
of everything that you're
tolerating right now.


00:56:28.151 --> 00:56:31.698
When we look around the
world at our current reality,


00:56:31.722 --> 00:56:34.067
what are we tolerating?


00:56:34.091 --> 00:56:35.468
Why?


00:56:43.934 --> 00:56:45.979
Getting in touch
with what's possible


00:56:46.003 --> 00:56:48.915
and tuning ourselves
to a greater resonance


00:56:48.939 --> 00:56:52.385
have beckoned humanity
throughout the ages.


00:56:52.409 --> 00:56:56.050
One method used all over
the world is breath meditation.


00:56:56.680 --> 00:56:57.991
With each breath,


00:56:58.015 --> 00:57:03.089
we literally draw the life force
of the Field into our bodies.


00:57:07.758 --> 00:57:11.504
So many of us have no idea
how we're breathing at all.


00:57:11.528 --> 00:57:14.841
And the number one way that
we can control our experience


00:57:14.865 --> 00:57:16.811
is to pay attention to our breath.


00:57:18.201 --> 00:57:19.779
Fear,


00:57:19.803 --> 00:57:21.748
<i>sadness,</i>


00:57:21.772 --> 00:57:23.449
<i>stress,</i>


00:57:23.473 --> 00:57:25.118
all of these things
that cause illness


00:57:25.142 --> 00:57:27.153
or even just like
physical pain, all of that,


00:57:27.177 --> 00:57:31.524
those are like low frequency
energies that we carry in our field.


00:57:31.548 --> 00:57:34.761
So just by using your breath,
by bringing in more oxygen,


00:57:34.785 --> 00:57:37.130
you kind of create this
high frequency circuit


00:57:37.154 --> 00:57:39.999
that literally can change
your electromagnetic field.


00:57:43.527 --> 00:57:47.073
When I was in Central
America checking out health technologies,


00:57:47.097 --> 00:57:51.878
I visited an extraordinary
healing center called Rythmia,


00:57:51.902 --> 00:57:54.212
where I was introduced
to plant medicine.


00:57:56.773 --> 00:57:58.117
For thousands of years,


00:57:58.141 --> 00:58:01.521
indigenous people have
used various plant medicines,


00:58:01.545 --> 00:58:03.218
including ayahuasca.


00:58:04.081 --> 00:58:07.226
When ingested in a sacred ceremony,


00:58:07.250 --> 00:58:11.898
these natural substances can create
an altered state of consciousness


00:58:11.922 --> 00:58:14.233
that's conducive to physical,


00:58:14.257 --> 00:58:17.704
emotional and
spiritual breakthroughs.


00:58:28.271 --> 00:58:31.918
One thing that
separates us from lots of other


00:58:31.942 --> 00:58:36.155
retreat centers and plant
medicine facilities and resorts


00:58:36.179 --> 00:58:38.825
is that we have a medical license.


00:58:38.849 --> 00:58:40.226
The benefit is


00:58:40.250 --> 00:58:42.821
that it puts people at great ease.


00:58:42.886 --> 00:58:46.733
And the whole goal
of plant medicine


00:58:46.757 --> 00:58:49.761
is to let people relax
enough to hear their soul.


00:58:52.863 --> 00:58:56.776
When I listened to the shamans at
Rythmia describe what they were doing,


00:58:56.800 --> 00:58:59.545
I remember later telling Foster,


00:58:59.569 --> 00:59:02.573
it was like I was listening
to the energy inventors.


00:59:02.939 --> 00:59:06.285
They were using
exactly the same terms.


00:59:06.309 --> 00:59:09.756
Vibration, frequency and resonance.


00:59:09.780 --> 00:59:11.191
It was wild.


00:59:47.017 --> 00:59:48.661
As my teacher explains,


00:59:48.685 --> 00:59:52.131
we humans, we're based
on sound. We're energy.


00:59:52.155 --> 00:59:53.933
So when we do healing,


00:59:53.957 --> 00:59:56.202
there's a block in the frequency.


00:59:56.226 --> 00:59:58.171
Somethings not matching up.


00:59:58.195 --> 01:00:00.907
And when we apply
the song or the prayer,


01:00:00.931 --> 01:00:04.811
there's the counter frequency
thereto bring balance or resonance


01:00:04.835 --> 01:00:06.940
within that person's
energetic field.


01:00:13.009 --> 01:00:15.888
During the journey
with the plant medicine,


01:00:15.912 --> 01:00:18.324
the reorganizing
is happening first.


01:00:18.348 --> 01:00:21.160
So it can come in shape and color.


01:00:21.184 --> 01:00:23.830
It can come as understanding.


01:00:23.854 --> 01:00:27.366
It can come as a death
and rebirth process.


01:00:27.390 --> 01:00:31.338
It can come as a
vision and insight.


01:00:33.196 --> 01:00:38.703
And there is always a subtle dialogue
between challenge and awakening.


01:02:51.034 --> 01:02:54.380
My experience with
ayahuasca transformed


01:02:54.404 --> 01:02:58.951
my relationship with my
mother, with my children,


01:02:58.975 --> 01:03:00.453
and most of all,


01:03:00.477 --> 01:03:05.424
the medicine showed me
that none of us is ever alone,


01:03:05.448 --> 01:03:09.929
that expanded consciousness
is always available


01:03:09.953 --> 01:03:16.035
waiting to be our most
exquisite, loving dance partner.


01:03:16.059 --> 01:03:21.474
I realized that science,
spirituality and ancient wisdom


01:03:21.498 --> 01:03:24.911
all converge in the Unified Field.


01:03:48.892 --> 01:03:51.504
The same ingenuity
and radical thinking


01:03:51.528 --> 01:03:55.508
that we experienced in the
realms of health and consciousness,


01:03:55.532 --> 01:03:58.444
we also encountered
in the world of energy.


01:03:58.468 --> 01:04:01.180
The inventors who claimed
they had engineered devices


01:04:01.204 --> 01:04:04.250
that could provide
limitless, clean energy,


01:04:04.274 --> 01:04:08.017
describe their work with the same
terms as the healers and shamans.


01:04:08.478 --> 01:04:12.558
Vibration, frequency, resonance.


01:04:12.582 --> 01:04:16.189
All characteristics of
interacting with the Unified Field.


01:04:20.924 --> 01:04:24.503
By looking at
mathematics, and music,


01:04:24.527 --> 01:04:27.206
and art, and science, physics,


01:04:27.230 --> 01:04:31.277
as all part of one continuum of
awareness and understanding,


01:04:31.301 --> 01:04:33.975
we can tackle the big problems.


01:04:52.889 --> 01:04:56.936
Understanding the musical
and mathematical nature of the cosmos,


01:04:56.960 --> 01:05:00.039
opens up a whole
new way of thinking.


01:05:00.063 --> 01:05:02.975
A great example of this
is an unlikely inventor


01:05:02.999 --> 01:05:05.978
that we found deep in
the jungles of Costa Rica,


01:05:06.002 --> 01:05:07.913
Heart Akerson.


01:05:09.005 --> 01:05:13.613
The way I learned to
think was with music.


01:05:14.077 --> 01:05:16.956
When you're
thinking in musical terms,


01:05:16.980 --> 01:05:20.325
you're thinking in another
structure and that structure


01:05:20.950 --> 01:05:24.921
could open up other doors
that are not accessible


01:05:25.688 --> 01:05:30.068
through verbal or
word-based communication.


01:05:42.105 --> 01:05:45.584
The core issue
of our whole civilization,


01:05:45.608 --> 01:05:49.422
the core reason for
non-sustainability


01:05:49.446 --> 01:05:51.357
comes from centralization.


01:05:52.115 --> 01:05:54.226
They have centralized education,


01:05:54.250 --> 01:05:57.997
centralized control of language,
centralized dictionaries,


01:05:58.021 --> 01:06:00.533
centralized government,
centralized religion,


01:06:00.557 --> 01:06:03.504
and centralized energy.


01:06:12.702 --> 01:06:15.247
You turn on a light switch
in your house,


01:06:15.271 --> 01:06:17.316
you click the switch,
the light comes on.


01:06:17.340 --> 01:06:19.084
What really happened?


01:06:19.108 --> 01:06:22.254
What really happened is
maybe a hundred miles away,


01:06:22.278 --> 01:06:25.157
there's a large generator


01:06:25.181 --> 01:06:30.196
producing enough electricity for
hundreds of thousands of houses.


01:06:30.220 --> 01:06:32.431
It comes out of that generator


01:06:32.455 --> 01:06:35.401
and gets transmitted with wires


01:06:35.425 --> 01:06:39.705
at probably a hundred
thousand volts.


01:06:39.729 --> 01:06:42.641
Then it goes into your house,
through your breaker box,


01:06:42.665 --> 01:06:46.011
through the meter that
the grid company has there


01:06:46.035 --> 01:06:49.014
and goes through your switch,


01:06:49.038 --> 01:06:50.749
which has just
completed the circuit,


01:06:50.773 --> 01:06:54.487
so that it can go through your light
bulb and make the light come on.


01:06:54.511 --> 01:06:58.257
That requires an enormous
amount of maintenance


01:06:58.281 --> 01:07:00.292
and capital expense to do that.


01:07:00.316 --> 01:07:03.162
So now we're
contrasting it to a house


01:07:03.186 --> 01:07:05.397
that has a transverter
solar system.


01:07:05.421 --> 01:07:07.333
That means in the utility room,


01:07:07.357 --> 01:07:10.269
there's some electronic boxes
with transverter stuff in them


01:07:10.293 --> 01:07:11.570
and there's some batteries,


01:07:11.594 --> 01:07:13.639
on the roof there's
some solar panels.


01:07:13.663 --> 01:07:16.775
And you also have a
connection to the grid.


01:07:16.799 --> 01:07:19.778
So when you throw that
switch, it completes the circuit,


01:07:19.802 --> 01:07:23.082
but it comes right
from the transverter.


01:07:23.106 --> 01:07:27.553
It immediately has access to
the energy from its batteries,


01:07:27.577 --> 01:07:29.355
the solar panels,


01:07:29.379 --> 01:07:30.585
the grid


01:07:31.214 --> 01:07:33.125
and maybe your next-door neighbor.


01:07:33.149 --> 01:07:37.630
The grid's importance, all of a
sudden, has been demoted.


01:07:37.654 --> 01:07:40.567
It's just one of many
possible sources.


01:07:45.461 --> 01:07:49.241
We discovered that there are three
main categories in the field of energy


01:07:49.265 --> 01:07:51.443
that we need to solve as a species.


01:07:51.467 --> 01:07:53.612
One of them is
generation of energy.


01:07:53.636 --> 01:07:54.813
How we get it?


01:07:54.837 --> 01:07:57.216
<i>Another is transmission of energy.</i>


01:07:57.240 --> 01:07:59.251
How to get it from
one place to another?


01:07:59.275 --> 01:08:02.121
And the third one is
integration of energy.


01:08:02.145 --> 01:08:04.625
How to get it into
the existing grid?


01:08:05.348 --> 01:08:07.593
Heart's work is the
best example we've found


01:08:07.617 --> 01:08:09.494
in the area of integration.


01:08:10.386 --> 01:08:15.768
His technology takes
solar, wind, geothermal


01:08:15.792 --> 01:08:19.204
or these various so-called
free energy technologies


01:08:19.228 --> 01:08:22.575
and adapts them to
homes or to local grids


01:08:22.599 --> 01:08:25.409
with what he calls
the Heart Transverter.


01:08:28.638 --> 01:08:32.384
The reason I got
the transverter system installed


01:08:32.408 --> 01:08:36.855
was because the power
here fluctuates quite a bit,


01:08:36.879 --> 01:08:39.382
and there's a lot of
power outages as well,


01:08:39.649 --> 01:08:41.627
and also having
the energy security,


01:08:41.651 --> 01:08:44.263
knowing that, you know, even
when the power grid went out,


01:08:44.287 --> 01:08:47.499
we always had our essential
electricity was running.


01:08:47.523 --> 01:08:52.538
Now we run two houses
with a number of refrigerators,


01:08:52.562 --> 01:08:55.839
a pool pump, fans,
even air conditioning.


01:08:56.899 --> 01:08:59.612
But we have a power
purchase agreement as well.


01:08:59.636 --> 01:09:02.214
So any excess power,
we get credit for.


01:09:02.238 --> 01:09:06.418
So our electricity bills now
run at about $10 a month,


01:09:06.442 --> 01:09:10.389
which is just the
rental for the meter.


01:09:10.413 --> 01:09:12.393
So there aren't really any bills.


01:09:17.487 --> 01:09:20.299
It's a micro-grid node.


01:09:20.323 --> 01:09:23.602
So it's capable of
sharing with its neighbors


01:09:23.626 --> 01:09:26.739
and its neighbors can cluster
together in larger micro-grids


01:09:26.763 --> 01:09:29.475
and share with other clusters.


01:09:29.499 --> 01:09:31.877
And so you're doing
it from the bottom up.


01:09:33.803 --> 01:09:36.715
The core thing is
the individual home,


01:09:36.739 --> 01:09:40.585
and it can work up to where
you support an entire civilization.


01:09:44.881 --> 01:09:47.418
It's kind of like a fractal.


01:09:48.451 --> 01:09:50.795
You've got a group at the home.


01:09:51.254 --> 01:09:53.766
You've got a bigger
cluster of these.


01:09:53.790 --> 01:09:56.769
And then those clusters
communicate with others,


01:09:56.793 --> 01:09:59.471
and it could cover the
whole city of Boston.


01:09:59.495 --> 01:10:01.805
It could cover the
whole United States.


01:10:03.232 --> 01:10:04.836
It could do our whole planet.


01:10:07.403 --> 01:10:09.515
We can't move
from where we are today


01:10:09.539 --> 01:10:13.652
to a hundred percent renewable
energy with the grid system that we have.


01:10:13.676 --> 01:10:15.621
Renewable energy
fluctuates too much


01:10:15.645 --> 01:10:18.957
so it collapses and affects
the grid in a negative way.


01:10:18.981 --> 01:10:21.359
Now Heart has created something


01:10:21.417 --> 01:10:24.630
where we can actually
transition from where we are today


01:10:24.654 --> 01:10:26.932
to a hundred percent
renewable energy


01:10:26.956 --> 01:10:30.602
without negatively
affecting the power grid.


01:10:30.626 --> 01:10:34.406
And just knowing that
we're part of that movement


01:10:34.430 --> 01:10:36.842
has been quite profound for me.


01:10:37.400 --> 01:10:40.946
We got to come up with
solutions that we can implement,


01:10:40.970 --> 01:10:42.210
like yesterday.


01:10:46.476 --> 01:10:48.620
One of the principles
of the Field is that


01:10:48.644 --> 01:10:50.856
it's infinitely dispersed.


01:10:50.880 --> 01:10:54.293
Decentralization is
aligned with that principle.


01:10:55.685 --> 01:10:57.663
We heard about these two brothers,


01:10:57.687 --> 01:10:59.698
James and Kenneth Corum,


01:10:59.722 --> 01:11:04.536
who spent the last 20 years
working on energy transmission.


01:11:04.560 --> 01:11:07.539
Their aim was to
reconstruct the technology


01:11:07.563 --> 01:11:10.544
behind Nikola Tesla's
Wardenclyffe Tower,


01:11:10.600 --> 01:11:14.343
which was built to
transmit energy wirelessly.


01:11:15.271 --> 01:11:19.785
That tower was destroyed by
Tesla's financier, JP Morgan,


01:11:19.809 --> 01:11:24.623
who realized that wireless transmission
would obsolete copper wiring


01:11:24.647 --> 01:11:27.856
and undermine the profits
from his own copper mines.


01:11:29.719 --> 01:11:32.598
Tesla was using the work
of a man named Zenneck


01:11:32.622 --> 01:11:36.034
who discovered a wave that
travels almost instantaneously


01:11:36.058 --> 01:11:38.537
in the Field around our planet.


01:11:38.561 --> 01:11:40.973
It follows the
surface of the Earth


01:11:40.997 --> 01:11:42.407
and when it moves,


01:11:42.431 --> 01:11:45.644
it doesn't have any harmful
effects on human beings.


01:11:45.668 --> 01:11:48.647
Tesla was looking to
ride the Zenneck wave


01:11:48.671 --> 01:11:51.982
to transmit both energy
and communications.


01:11:53.442 --> 01:11:57.456
The Corum brothers have apparently
now recreated that technology


01:11:57.480 --> 01:11:59.358
with modern materials


01:11:59.382 --> 01:12:02.022
and achieved what
Tesla had set out to do.


01:12:02.618 --> 01:12:05.292
You'll be able to put
an antenna on your car


01:12:05.354 --> 01:12:07.733
that will just tap the
Field for electricity.


01:12:07.757 --> 01:12:09.868
You'll be able to put
one on your home


01:12:09.892 --> 01:12:12.371
or your local power station.


01:12:12.395 --> 01:12:15.707
That energy can be tapped by
an ocean liner crossing the sea


01:12:15.731 --> 01:12:17.476
with an antenna on top


01:12:17.500 --> 01:12:19.980
without burning
any polluting fuels.


01:12:20.803 --> 01:12:24.817
The Zenneck technology is the best
one we found for transmitting energy


01:12:24.841 --> 01:12:27.481
in a low cost and healthy way.


01:12:29.445 --> 01:12:34.092
These innovations in energy
integration and transmission are brilliant


01:12:34.116 --> 01:12:39.665
and make it possible to keep a lot
of our existing infrastructure in place.


01:12:39.689 --> 01:12:43.034
Of course, we also really
need clean energy sources


01:12:43.092 --> 01:12:48.106
that are decentralized and affordable
for them to transmit and integrate.


01:12:48.130 --> 01:12:52.945
Tapping into a field of infinite
energy would do so much


01:12:52.969 --> 01:12:58.717
to improve the actual daily lives of
all of us everywhere on this planet.


01:12:58.741 --> 01:13:02.120
That's why we've spent so
much of our time and resources


01:13:02.144 --> 01:13:04.022
investigating inventors


01:13:04.046 --> 01:13:07.493
who claimed breakthroughs
in the generation of energy.


01:13:07.884 --> 01:13:11.430
One promising energy
source comes from hydrogen.


01:13:11.454 --> 01:13:14.566
It's the most abundant
element in the entire universe.


01:13:14.590 --> 01:13:16.467
It's essentially everywhere.


01:13:17.093 --> 01:13:20.939
The key to hydrogen is that
when it's ignited it creates heat


01:13:20.963 --> 01:13:23.705
and the heat can be
transferred into power.


01:13:24.100 --> 01:13:27.446
So if we can do that
efficiently and inexpensively,


01:13:27.470 --> 01:13:30.449
then we can use it to
run our cars, our factories,


01:13:30.473 --> 01:13:32.150
or an entire community.


01:13:32.174 --> 01:13:34.686
It could substitute for dirty coal


01:13:34.710 --> 01:13:38.156
and repurpose the
15,000+ coal plants


01:13:38.180 --> 01:13:40.158
that are wreaking
havoc with the Earth,


01:13:40.182 --> 01:13:43.028
the miners and the
people living nearby.


01:13:43.052 --> 01:13:46.064
It could also replace
nuclear and fracking.


01:13:46.088 --> 01:13:49.468
But currently, extracting
hydrogen from water


01:13:49.492 --> 01:13:51.836
is too expensive to
be a viable option.


01:13:52.094 --> 01:13:54.773
In Thailand, however,
we found a guy


01:13:54.797 --> 01:13:59.678
who claimed his team had discovered
a way to access hydrogen for fuel


01:13:59.702 --> 01:14:03.616
absolutely cleanly
and for virtually nothing.


01:14:04.774 --> 01:14:07.786
The inventor himself does
not do media appearances,


01:14:07.810 --> 01:14:11.089
but he authorized one of his
technicians who built the device


01:14:11.113 --> 01:14:12.683
to give us a tour.


01:14:14.550 --> 01:14:17.629
There's gas
in the water you can burn


01:14:17.653 --> 01:14:20.133
so you can make
a fire out of water.


01:14:21.757 --> 01:14:26.004
This inventor apparently has
found a way to use earth minerals


01:14:26.028 --> 01:14:28.106
in a pressurized vortex


01:14:28.130 --> 01:14:32.010
to access pure hydrogen
cheaply and efficiently.


01:14:32.034 --> 01:14:33.879
We found an easy
way to make hydrogen.


01:14:33.903 --> 01:14:39.051
We don't need a big
fancy electrolysis factory.


01:14:39.075 --> 01:14:44.523
We find a system where
the hydrogen comes out


01:14:44.547 --> 01:14:46.625
from a kind of chemical reaction.


01:14:46.649 --> 01:14:48.660
We have some special mix.


01:14:48.684 --> 01:14:51.863
The device that they've
created to extract hydrogen


01:14:51.887 --> 01:14:55.733
is as beautiful as any energy
technology I've ever seen.


01:14:56.692 --> 01:15:01.974
They found the secret of how to
catalyze a reaction in this compound


01:15:01.998 --> 01:15:05.241
that then just gives off
essentially free hydrogen.


01:15:06.936 --> 01:15:10.182
We asked ourselves the question,
'What does the world need?"


01:15:10.206 --> 01:15:13.210
We think hydrogen is the
best way to solve this problem.


01:15:14.910 --> 01:15:18.084
I was encouraged by the hydrogen
device still under development.


01:15:18.147 --> 01:15:19.825
And what also really excited me


01:15:19.849 --> 01:15:22.728
were the technologies
for extracting energy


01:15:22.752 --> 01:15:24.062
directly from the Field.


01:15:24.086 --> 01:15:26.598
For over 20 years,
I've searched the world


01:15:26.622 --> 01:15:28.834
for working free energy devices.


01:15:30.893 --> 01:15:33.672
A really common
objection to even the notion


01:15:33.696 --> 01:15:35.741
of a free energy device


01:15:35.765 --> 01:15:37.542
is that it can't be


01:15:37.566 --> 01:15:40.145
because physics has
certain proven laws


01:15:40.169 --> 01:15:42.046
and this would be
in violation of that.


01:15:43.039 --> 01:15:45.851
So, if in fact, there is a device


01:15:45.875 --> 01:15:48.854
that is running without
being plugged into anything


01:15:48.878 --> 01:15:51.623
for long periods of
time such that it proves


01:15:51.647 --> 01:15:54.693
that it's accessing energy
from somewhere else,


01:15:54.717 --> 01:15:58.663
then either the law is wrong
or the law is misunderstood.


01:15:58.687 --> 01:16:02.999
And I think, for the most
part, the law is misunderstood.


01:16:05.694 --> 01:16:07.739
The First Law
of Thermodynamics


01:16:07.763 --> 01:16:11.109
states that an isolated
energy-producing system


01:16:11.133 --> 01:16:14.603
can't generate more
energy than goes into it.


01:16:15.037 --> 01:16:18.050
This may be correct
within closed systems.


01:16:18.074 --> 01:16:19.178
But atoms,


01:16:20.076 --> 01:16:21.286
<i>suns,</i>


01:16:21.310 --> 01:16:22.788
galaxies,


01:16:22.812 --> 01:16:25.323
and the cosmos itself,


01:16:25.347 --> 01:16:27.893
like the magnet
on your refrigerator,


01:16:27.917 --> 01:16:29.658
are open systems.


01:16:33.022 --> 01:16:35.200
The successful
devices we are seeing


01:16:35.224 --> 01:16:38.270
are specifically designed as open,


01:16:38.294 --> 01:16:40.103
<i>not isolated systems.</i>


01:16:40.996 --> 01:16:44.170
So, the limitations of
the First Law don't apply


01:16:44.233 --> 01:16:48.079
when it comes to accessing
energy from one realm to another.


01:16:54.310 --> 01:16:56.721
I learned about
a young man in Africa


01:16:56.745 --> 01:16:59.624
who claimed to have
built a car, a generator,


01:16:59.682 --> 01:17:03.195
and even a helicopter that
ran on radio frequencies.


01:17:03.219 --> 01:17:07.299
A true free energy device that
keeps batteries consistently charged.


01:17:07.323 --> 01:17:09.367
It took me several
months to find him,


01:17:09.391 --> 01:17:12.871
but when I did, it blew my mind.


01:17:12.895 --> 01:17:14.940
I knew it
would be complicated


01:17:14.964 --> 01:17:17.308
because these things always are.


01:17:18.134 --> 01:17:19.778
Going to Zimbabwe,


01:17:19.802 --> 01:17:25.050
the Ethiopian airline that we had
tickets with had just had a major crash,


01:17:25.074 --> 01:17:29.716
and a cyclone had just ravaged
the area, leaving hundreds dead.


01:17:33.115 --> 01:17:37.629
Well, we're sitting in a hotel
in Harare, Zimbabwe this morning.


01:17:37.653 --> 01:17:39.331
We're here today to
start the vetting process


01:17:39.355 --> 01:17:41.700
and find out, okay, what's real.


01:17:41.724 --> 01:17:45.737
Over 95% of the time, these
things aren't what they claim to be.


01:17:45.761 --> 01:17:49.875
<i>This time we took engineer Nils
Rognerud to assist with the vetting.</i>


01:17:49.899 --> 01:17:52.344
When Nils and I
arrived and met Maxwell,


01:17:52.368 --> 01:17:56.948
I was very impressed with just what
a gentle, true-seeming soul he was.


01:17:56.972 --> 01:17:59.417
And then the next morning,
we went to see the device,


01:17:59.441 --> 01:18:01.153
and he gave us a full tour.


01:18:01.177 --> 01:18:03.388
I was practically ecstatic.


01:18:03.412 --> 01:18:06.689
It was such a beautiful,
elegant device.


01:18:07.082 --> 01:18:08.193
What we're looking at,


01:18:08.217 --> 01:18:11.930
it is called the green
power off-grid machine.


01:18:11.954 --> 01:18:13.865
It is half a megawatt


01:18:13.889 --> 01:18:16.735
and we are aligned
with the radio frequency


01:18:16.759 --> 01:18:20.297
behind this radio frequency
converted into pure energy that is useful.


01:18:21.297 --> 01:18:24.342
It is called a
microsonic energy device.


01:18:24.366 --> 01:18:26.077
A microsonic energy device,


01:18:26.101 --> 01:18:29.207
it is the generator
in this machine.


01:18:30.773 --> 01:18:32.817
For people who
are not familiar with this,


01:18:32.841 --> 01:18:33.885
half a megawatt,


01:18:33.909 --> 01:18:37.722
how much will that power in terms
of a house or a community or what?


01:18:37.746 --> 01:18:41.250
We're talking about 300
standard house/homes.


01:18:42.084 --> 01:18:43.995
- Okay.
- That you can power with one machine.


01:18:44.019 --> 01:18:47.933
So there's no oil burning.
There's no fires going on or anything.


01:18:47.957 --> 01:18:50.702
So where's the energy coming from?


01:18:50.726 --> 01:18:53.104
We're harnessing it
straight away from the--


01:18:53.128 --> 01:18:56.107
the natural energy
that's God has just put


01:18:56.131 --> 01:18:59.908
in our air, the radio frequency.


01:19:00.402 --> 01:19:03.014
So nothing unusual,
but the main point is that


01:19:03.038 --> 01:19:06.218
a meter away, there's no
frequencies being transmitted


01:19:06.242 --> 01:19:11.351
from a microwave tower next
to the park we're standing in.


01:19:12.147 --> 01:19:14.491
It's a poignant
day for us here.


01:19:15.217 --> 01:19:19.130
And amidst the excitement
of seeing this for the first time,


01:19:19.154 --> 01:19:21.766
a couple of strangers
showed up on the site


01:19:21.790 --> 01:19:24.169
where we were being
shown these devices,


01:19:24.193 --> 01:19:28.740
and Maxwell, the inventor, took us
aside as soon as he could and said,


01:19:28.764 --> 01:19:30.208
These guys are from the government


01:19:30.232 --> 01:19:32.210
and I didn't know
they were coming."


01:19:32.234 --> 01:19:36.982
Unfortunately, we're truly
concerned about this gentleman,


01:19:37.006 --> 01:19:40.952
and we're just going to take
every precaution that we can


01:19:40.976 --> 01:19:43.455
to keep ourselves
safe, to keep him safe,


01:19:43.479 --> 01:19:45.957
and to keep this knowledge safe.


01:19:45.981 --> 01:19:49.894
The microphone we had on
Maxwell picked up the conversation


01:19:49.918 --> 01:19:52.030
that he had with
one of the officials.


01:19:52.054 --> 01:19:54.332
So we quickly got
the tape translated


01:19:54.356 --> 01:19:58.436
and found out that the government
official was promising Maxwell


01:19:58.460 --> 01:20:00.372
a power purchase agreement


01:20:00.396 --> 01:20:04.075
where the government would pay him
for generating energy for the country.


01:20:04.099 --> 01:20:05.877
It was good corroboration


01:20:05.901 --> 01:20:08.280
that they believed he
had what he claimed,


01:20:08.304 --> 01:20:10.115
although Maxwell didn't trust him,


01:20:10.139 --> 01:20:13.018
because the government
had already put him in prison


01:20:13.042 --> 01:20:15.420
in an effort to steal
his technology.


01:20:16.912 --> 01:20:19.552
In fact, when
Maxwell was put in prison,


01:20:19.815 --> 01:20:24.229
he was put in a cell with one
of the richest guys in Zimbabwe,


01:20:24.253 --> 01:20:25.964
a man named Genius


01:20:25.988 --> 01:20:27.098
- that's his real name -


01:20:27.122 --> 01:20:31.236
whom the government had
jailed to extort more money from.


01:20:31.260 --> 01:20:36.274
Maxwell was in great despair and
praying for like 5 or 6 hours at a time.


01:20:36.298 --> 01:20:38.310
It was driving Genius crazy,


01:20:38.334 --> 01:20:41.246
and he was saying, 'Why are
you praying so much? Shut up!"


01:20:41.270 --> 01:20:43.214
Finally, they ended up talking


01:20:43.238 --> 01:20:46.084
and Genius was impressed and said,


01:20:46.108 --> 01:20:48.153
Okay, I'll help you, man.


01:20:48.177 --> 01:20:50.955
It was the most unlikely,


01:20:50.979 --> 01:20:52.924
cQuldnT-have-scripted-it way


01:20:52.948 --> 01:20:55.960
for Maxwell to be able to
have somebody on his team


01:20:55.984 --> 01:20:58.530
with real business
savvy and support.


01:20:58.554 --> 01:21:01.566
And it was forged
right there in prison.


01:21:01.590 --> 01:21:03.126
I love that!


01:21:04.393 --> 01:21:10.241
So when we were in prison,
Maxwell was praying every now and then.


01:21:10.265 --> 01:21:13.474
So I was like, 'Why do you
pray like that? That's too much!"


01:21:14.336 --> 01:21:16.907
From the time I have known him,


01:21:17.406 --> 01:21:19.317
I have learned a lot from him.


01:21:19.541 --> 01:21:23.154
He sees people, I think,
the way God sees people.


01:21:23.178 --> 01:21:24.622
I think you saw it
when you were driving,


01:21:24.646 --> 01:21:27.492
people can just block his way.


01:21:27.516 --> 01:21:30.495
Not to attack him,
but everyone likes him.


01:21:30.519 --> 01:21:33.125
If you just
deal with the right people,


01:21:34.123 --> 01:21:36.364
me and Maxwell will
take this to another level.


01:21:36.959 --> 01:21:39.971
We were feeling very
excited about our progress with Maxwell


01:21:39.995 --> 01:21:41.940
and hoped that we would
soon be able to conduct


01:21:41.964 --> 01:21:44.175
a thorough vetting of the device.


01:21:44.199 --> 01:21:46.475
However, we started
running into issues.


01:21:46.535 --> 01:21:49.247
Suspicions of our
motives and intentions


01:21:49.271 --> 01:21:52.343
were starting to circulate
amongst Maxwell's advisers.


01:21:53.942 --> 01:21:57.055
So, Maxwell
sent this note saying,


01:21:57.079 --> 01:21:58.490
Hi Foster, we have talked


01:21:58.514 --> 01:22:01.459
and I'm advised that the
further tests you requested


01:22:01.483 --> 01:22:05.124
won't be possible because
of a number of issues such as,


01:22:06.355 --> 01:22:07.332
one,


01:22:07.356 --> 01:22:10.030
where it's intended to be used


01:22:10.592 --> 01:22:13.605
if on investors..."


01:22:13.629 --> 01:22:16.374
The single most important
thing of all this to me is


01:22:16.398 --> 01:22:19.043
we do the duration
test so we find out


01:22:19.067 --> 01:22:23.072
do we think that this technology
is real as claimed or not.


01:22:30.646 --> 01:22:32.319
Call declined.


01:22:37.219 --> 01:22:38.562
Okay, then.


01:22:40.322 --> 01:22:42.534
So I'm trying to get
in touch with Maxwell


01:22:42.558 --> 01:22:46.204
because we're down to
our last day, once again.


01:22:46.228 --> 01:22:49.340
Within the next few hours,
we need to make a decision:


01:22:49.364 --> 01:22:52.436
Are we going to change
reservations once again


01:22:53.168 --> 01:22:56.714
and stay over, which is going
to be a real hit on our budget?


01:22:56.738 --> 01:22:59.514
But this is what it takes.


01:23:04.413 --> 01:23:08.560
Is he ultimately,
consciously or subconsciously,


01:23:08.584 --> 01:23:12.564
trying to get us so that
we either have to leave,


01:23:12.588 --> 01:23:15.533
we just can't wait around
any longer so we don't get


01:23:15.557 --> 01:23:17.502
the result we came for,


01:23:17.526 --> 01:23:22.339
and we don't get to expose some
potential problem with the thing?


01:23:27.769 --> 01:23:29.147
I don't know.


01:23:29.171 --> 01:23:30.275
I don't know either.


01:23:32.608 --> 01:23:35.620
For me, the low point
of that whole trip to Zimbabwe


01:23:35.644 --> 01:23:39.357
was when we had been waiting in
the hotel room for a number of days


01:23:39.381 --> 01:23:41.192
and we were getting these texts


01:23:41.216 --> 01:23:45.096
with kind of false
accusations and suspicions,


01:23:45.120 --> 01:23:47.131
and then one came in that said,


01:23:47.155 --> 01:23:50.500
When's your plane?
You should just go.


01:23:51.760 --> 01:23:53.171
That was like the moment of,


01:23:53.195 --> 01:23:57.200
okay, he's not just stalling.
He's saying, "Go away."


01:23:58.100 --> 01:24:01.779
So that's when I really had to
search deep inside myself for


01:24:01.803 --> 01:24:03.748
Can I put up with this?


01:24:03.772 --> 01:24:07.719
Do I think he has the capability
to actually come around?"


01:24:07.743 --> 01:24:10.788
But both of those things
get resolved for me in


01:24:10.812 --> 01:24:13.191
I don't know if he's
gonna come around,


01:24:13.215 --> 01:24:15.252
but I know that I'm true.


01:24:15.684 --> 01:24:17.529
His suspicions are false.


01:24:17.553 --> 01:24:19.531
So that if I can just hang in there


01:24:19.555 --> 01:24:22.600
and actually get into
reality again with him,


01:24:22.624 --> 01:24:24.569
at least we've got a shot.


01:24:24.593 --> 01:24:26.771
And I pictured being on the plane,


01:24:26.795 --> 01:24:29.407
going home with a complete failure


01:24:29.431 --> 01:24:32.110
and not knowing and the possibility


01:24:32.134 --> 01:24:35.280
that this was maybe the best
energy device I've ever seen


01:24:35.304 --> 01:24:38.547
and we got kicked out
based on misunderstandings?


01:24:39.241 --> 01:24:43.354
That was so much more horrible to
me than the obnoxious need to wait


01:24:43.378 --> 01:24:45.824
and the expenses that were
being accrued in the process of it.


01:24:48.250 --> 01:24:50.595
Just when our hope
was beginning to fade,


01:24:50.619 --> 01:24:52.630
we received a text from Maxwell.


01:24:52.654 --> 01:24:56.134
He was ready for us to conduct
a full vetting of the device.


01:24:56.158 --> 01:24:58.236
We're not sure what had changed,


01:24:58.260 --> 01:25:00.605
but we were excited
and ready to go.


01:25:03.231 --> 01:25:06.311
One final hurdle was
finding some additional batteries


01:25:06.335 --> 01:25:07.812
the inventor needed for the test.


01:25:07.836 --> 01:25:10.682
Okay, so we're trying to
come up with enough money


01:25:10.706 --> 01:25:13.318
to buy the rest of the batteries


01:25:13.342 --> 01:25:17.288
that the inventor needs to
do the test this afternoon


01:25:17.312 --> 01:25:18.823
before we're supposed
to leave tomorrow.


01:25:18.847 --> 01:25:22.427
Max explained that the energy
tapped from radio frequencies


01:25:22.451 --> 01:25:23.828
runs through batteries.


01:25:23.852 --> 01:25:25.730
So the batteries
don't lose their charge.


01:25:25.754 --> 01:25:28.257
But you still need
them for the process.


01:25:30.225 --> 01:25:32.870
Found another envelope in the safe.


01:25:32.894 --> 01:25:36.741
This is Zimbabwe petty cash.


01:25:36.765 --> 01:25:40.872
We have another $90, folks.


01:25:48.276 --> 01:25:49.520
The biggest boss.


01:25:51.713 --> 01:25:52.885
You're a good friend.


01:25:53.548 --> 01:25:55.526
Thank you so much
for helping us out today.


01:25:55.550 --> 01:25:56.824
This is the big day.


01:25:58.220 --> 01:26:00.565
What we're doing
today will be so important


01:26:00.589 --> 01:26:02.300
for Maxwell and for you,


01:26:02.324 --> 01:26:05.203
with other people who are
interested in the technology.


01:26:05.227 --> 01:26:08.439
Ultimately, they need
to know that it lasts


01:26:08.463 --> 01:26:10.775
long enough to prove
what the device does.


01:26:10.799 --> 01:26:13.344
And then also, Nils
will be measuring


01:26:13.368 --> 01:26:15.647
the voltage of the
batteries during the test


01:26:15.671 --> 01:26:19.710
and that will reveal whether
it's what he has claimed or not.


01:26:22.544 --> 01:26:25.156
So I'm sitting here
in Mr. Genius' office.


01:26:25.180 --> 01:26:28.760
We've just taken the next step
toward getting this vetting done


01:26:28.784 --> 01:26:30.889
because they didn't
have the right batteries.


01:26:30.952 --> 01:26:33.164
They didn't have enough
batteries in the device


01:26:33.188 --> 01:26:35.366
to do the duration
test that we need.


01:26:35.390 --> 01:26:39.837
The inventor did not have enough
cash to buy all the new batteries


01:26:39.861 --> 01:26:41.472
so we needed to get cash


01:26:41.496 --> 01:26:45.943
and you cannot get cash
out of banks or currency shops


01:26:45.967 --> 01:26:47.945
or anything in Zimbabwe right now.


01:26:47.969 --> 01:26:50.415
So, fortunately, Mr. Genius said,


01:26:50.439 --> 01:26:54.285
Come to my office and
we can swipe a credit card


01:26:54.309 --> 01:26:55.553
and get you the cash and


01:26:55.577 --> 01:26:57.255
take you over and
get you the batteries."


01:26:57.279 --> 01:27:02.527
So that transaction has taken
place with a little extra drama.


01:27:02.551 --> 01:27:04.758
We're home free to
the next step anyway.


01:27:13.562 --> 01:27:16.839
Big Blue started at 4:36 PM.


01:27:17.466 --> 01:27:19.977
We're here with Maxwell


01:27:20.001 --> 01:27:21.981
and the test is starting.


01:27:22.637 --> 01:27:24.315
Once we arrived on site,


01:27:24.339 --> 01:27:26.517
our goal for the
vetting was to establish


01:27:26.541 --> 01:27:29.320
that the device could
power a welding machine,


01:27:29.344 --> 01:27:31.823
which uses a lot of
electricity very quickly,


01:27:31.847 --> 01:27:35.454
for long enough that it couldn't
be running on batteries alone.


01:27:38.019 --> 01:27:40.431
So you were asking
where the energy came from.


01:27:40.455 --> 01:27:41.933
You mentioned the
other day, the sun.


01:27:41.957 --> 01:27:44.368
But it's not like solar
energy, light.


01:27:44.392 --> 01:27:45.603
It isn't solar energy


01:27:45.627 --> 01:27:47.805
because this one is not
even affected with


01:27:47.829 --> 01:27:50.341
- Clouds, light and things like that.
- Right.


01:27:50.365 --> 01:27:51.476
It just works.


01:27:51.500 --> 01:27:57.348
So the the energy, the radio
frequencies that you're harnessing,


01:27:57.372 --> 01:28:01.445
are they there in space,
in the Field all the time?


01:28:01.510 --> 01:28:02.520
Yes, they are.


01:28:02.544 --> 01:28:03.921
From the first day


01:28:03.945 --> 01:28:06.524
we set up the machine,
we have been analyzing


01:28:06.548 --> 01:28:08.359
and you saw that the
radio frequency is there.


01:28:08.383 --> 01:28:11.562
But one thing that we
don't know for sure is,


01:28:11.586 --> 01:28:13.030
is it alien


01:28:13.054 --> 01:28:14.699
or is it God?


01:28:14.723 --> 01:28:16.834
Is it man-made from another planet?


01:28:16.858 --> 01:28:18.770
Or is it from God?


01:28:18.794 --> 01:28:23.841
That's where we need, I think,
scientific people to define exactly.


01:28:23.865 --> 01:28:26.505
But we know the rate of frequency,
we have everything.


01:28:27.869 --> 01:28:30.982
If it's still a fully
charged battery,


01:28:31.006 --> 01:28:32.849
the test is successful.


01:28:33.842 --> 01:28:35.753
- Oh, that's 217.
- 217.9


01:28:35.777 --> 01:28:37.654
That's perfect.


01:28:41.016 --> 01:28:42.827
So, that's the eighteenth battery.


01:28:42.851 --> 01:28:44.028
Yes, that's the eighteenth battery.


01:28:44.052 --> 01:28:47.033
So that's higher than
the nominal voltage.


01:28:48.356 --> 01:28:49.528
Dude!


01:28:50.058 --> 01:28:51.602
- Wow!
- Thank you so much.


01:28:51.626 --> 01:28:53.367
That is awesome!


01:28:53.695 --> 01:28:56.774
That's eighteen 12-volt batteries.


01:28:56.798 --> 01:29:00.075
So it has higher voltage than 216.


01:29:00.669 --> 01:29:02.079
- Thank you.
- Give us two thumbs up!


01:29:02.103 --> 01:29:03.741
Thank you. Thank you so much.


01:29:05.340 --> 01:29:07.618
One final check
of the battery voltage


01:29:07.642 --> 01:29:09.921
revealed a shocking result.


01:29:09.945 --> 01:29:13.858
Not only had the machine
outlasted the expected battery life,


01:29:13.882 --> 01:29:17.862
but the batteries
were still fully charged.


01:29:17.886 --> 01:29:20.865
This proved that the
device was being powered


01:29:20.889 --> 01:29:22.967
from an unknown energy source.


01:29:22.991 --> 01:29:24.035
Thank you.


01:29:24.059 --> 01:29:27.071
This is one of the
happiest days of my life


01:29:27.095 --> 01:29:31.876
and I am so proud of this man
who has gone through so much.


01:29:31.900 --> 01:29:35.513
He's listened to the voice of
the divine coming through him,


01:29:35.537 --> 01:29:39.650
and he's done whatever it takes
to bring this through for humanity.


01:29:39.674 --> 01:29:42.987
- So, congratulations, my friend.
- Thank you so much.


01:29:43.011 --> 01:29:44.649
Aah!


01:29:45.914 --> 01:29:47.692
Now we're gonna get you well.


01:29:47.716 --> 01:29:50.026
Thank you so much.
Thank you so much.


01:29:52.020 --> 01:29:53.598
I got your emojis.


01:29:53.622 --> 01:29:56.033
We just finished.
Just got back to the hotel


01:29:56.057 --> 01:29:59.604
after a completely
successful vetting.


01:29:59.628 --> 01:30:00.705
Oh my God!


01:30:00.729 --> 01:30:03.641
I really wanna honor that


01:30:03.665 --> 01:30:06.477
this could not have
happened without you.


01:30:06.501 --> 01:30:08.708
Every one of us would have left


01:30:09.971 --> 01:30:12.884
in that situation.


01:30:12.908 --> 01:30:16.153
I'm just super super
grateful for that.


01:30:16.177 --> 01:30:21.459
And I'm super grateful that we have
an opportunity for people to see it.


01:30:21.483 --> 01:30:24.862
Because it helps people so
much to know what's possible.


01:30:24.886 --> 01:30:28.799
The test we did
yesterday is, like, historic.


01:30:28.823 --> 01:30:31.997
I'm still digesting it because


01:30:32.594 --> 01:30:35.439
it basically means
the end of fossil fuels.


01:30:42.837 --> 01:30:44.982
I'd say the main
thing that I have learned


01:30:45.006 --> 01:30:46.717
personally from this trip,


01:30:46.741 --> 01:30:48.886
it's more a reinforcement


01:30:48.910 --> 01:30:53.724
of something that I know but,
you know, doubt now and then,


01:30:53.748 --> 01:30:56.894
is that whatever the question,


01:30:56.918 --> 01:30:59.730
the answer is always more love


01:30:59.754 --> 01:31:03.601
because our relationship with
this inventor was on the rocks.


01:31:03.625 --> 01:31:05.102
You know, it was
tempting to just say,


01:31:05.126 --> 01:31:08.873
Hey! I came to help you. If you
don't want it, we're out of here.


01:31:08.897 --> 01:31:13.444
And I know from past experience
that, you know, wait through that.


01:31:13.468 --> 01:31:15.947
That's not a great emotional
place to make a decision from.


01:31:15.971 --> 01:31:19.016
And we just kept
telling him the truth,


01:31:19.040 --> 01:31:20.551
even when he didn't believe it,


01:31:20.575 --> 01:31:23.454
and then loving him even
when he couldn't allow it in.


01:31:23.478 --> 01:31:24.689
And at the end,


01:31:24.713 --> 01:31:27.458
being with us, he could see that,


01:31:27.482 --> 01:31:29.560
number one: our motives were true.


01:31:29.584 --> 01:31:33.794
And number two: we
were treating him with love.


01:31:34.255 --> 01:31:37.735
We've spent the last eight
years traveling the globe


01:31:37.759 --> 01:31:40.638
in search of insights
and technologies


01:31:40.662 --> 01:31:43.708
that could radically
transform our world.


01:31:43.732 --> 01:31:45.109
And we found them.


01:31:45.600 --> 01:31:50.208
So why don't we all have access
to these promising breakthroughs?


01:32:10.191 --> 01:32:13.671
We don't have access to these
world-changing breakthroughs


01:32:13.695 --> 01:32:15.973
because we're not
allowed to have them.


01:32:15.997 --> 01:32:18.676
Virtually every solution we found


01:32:18.700 --> 01:32:21.645
has been made
illegal or suppressed,


01:32:21.669 --> 01:32:23.114
often violently.


01:32:23.138 --> 01:32:25.549
Maxwell has been imprisoned


01:32:25.573 --> 01:32:28.252
and tortured to try
to get his secrets.


01:32:28.276 --> 01:32:33.124
And he and his first partner,
before Genius, were both poisoned.


01:32:33.148 --> 01:32:35.628
Maxwell's still recovering from it


01:32:35.683 --> 01:32:37.594
and his partner died.


01:32:38.086 --> 01:32:42.233
One of the painful realities


01:32:42.257 --> 01:32:45.169
I have seen in energy is


01:32:45.193 --> 01:32:48.873
this is a very dangerous
game altogether.


01:32:48.897 --> 01:32:50.808
Yeah, especially, free energy


01:32:50.832 --> 01:32:54.245
because, you know, as I said,


01:32:54.269 --> 01:32:59.917
they can try to kill it
using professional people


01:32:59.941 --> 01:33:01.852
and that has happened to me.


01:33:01.876 --> 01:33:04.155
I went through a lot, poisons,


01:33:04.179 --> 01:33:06.921
like I'm saying right
now, I'm fighting it.


01:33:07.615 --> 01:33:10.687
They come to you, then
they say, "No, you mustn't do this."


01:33:11.820 --> 01:33:14.865
When they see that
you're not giving up,


01:33:14.889 --> 01:33:16.133
then they can just frame you.


01:33:16.157 --> 01:33:18.102
Then they can say, "No,
you have done ABC."


01:33:18.126 --> 01:33:21.335
My prayer is this thing
must see the light of the day.


01:34:07.208 --> 01:34:10.387
Innovators in any
one sector often think


01:34:10.411 --> 01:34:13.991
that theirs is the only
one being curtailed.


01:34:14.015 --> 01:34:16.256
That's not our conclusion.


01:34:16.851 --> 01:34:20.164
Dr. Young, whose
non-pharmaceutical healing treatments


01:34:20.188 --> 01:34:24.102
were simple and effective,
has also been imprisoned.


01:34:24.859 --> 01:34:27.705
This is the spot
where I was arrested.


01:34:27.729 --> 01:34:30.941
So I had 13 counts of fraud,


01:34:30.965 --> 01:34:34.211
12 counts of practicing
medicine without a license


01:34:34.235 --> 01:34:36.272
and one count of conspiracy.


01:34:36.838 --> 01:34:38.215
I was found guilty


01:34:38.239 --> 01:34:42.286
on two charges of practicing
medicine without a license.


01:34:42.310 --> 01:34:46.056
So out of those 320 clients,


01:34:46.080 --> 01:34:48.926
I was found guilty on
practicing medicine.


01:34:48.950 --> 01:34:52.129
The one was changing an IV,


01:34:52.153 --> 01:34:54.793
and the other one was
removing an IV bag.


01:34:55.123 --> 01:34:56.830
So that's what I'm guilty of.


01:34:58.092 --> 01:35:01.005
The sentence was the
most extreme.


01:35:01.029 --> 01:35:03.407
It was 3.7 years.


01:35:04.232 --> 01:35:06.043
On our way to see Dr. Young,


01:35:06.067 --> 01:35:08.279
we randomly stopped
at a coffee shop


01:35:08.303 --> 01:35:11.716
where we met a woman who
had worked with him at his ranch.


01:35:12.140 --> 01:35:15.786
In my first week there, I
delivered a plate of food


01:35:15.810 --> 01:35:18.255
to a resident in
one of the trailers


01:35:18.279 --> 01:35:22.426
and I remember seeing he had
a tumor on the back of his head.


01:35:22.450 --> 01:35:24.695
After about a month or two,


01:35:24.719 --> 01:35:26.130
he had checked out.


01:35:26.154 --> 01:35:27.765
He was ready to go home


01:35:27.789 --> 01:35:30.834
and there was nothing but a
smooth piece of gauze there


01:35:30.858 --> 01:35:33.361
like it had just melted away.


01:35:34.195 --> 01:35:38.008
I remember just looking
through the news one morning


01:35:38.032 --> 01:35:41.145
and seeing an article about
a doctor from Valley Center


01:35:41.169 --> 01:35:43.447
who had been arrested
or who was on trial,


01:35:43.471 --> 01:35:48.750
and when I clicked on it, I
couldn't believe who it was.


01:35:50.378 --> 01:35:52.051
It just seemed...


01:35:53.414 --> 01:35:56.260
It makes me feel a
bit emotional actually.


01:35:56.284 --> 01:35:58.321
It seemed very


01:36:00.054 --> 01:36:02.261
wrong for somebody who


01:36:03.958 --> 01:36:06.438
just wanted to heal and help people


01:36:07.962 --> 01:36:09.464
to be put through that.


01:36:14.035 --> 01:36:16.379
My approach is to educate
and empower people


01:36:16.437 --> 01:36:18.782
on how to take
care of their bodies.


01:36:18.806 --> 01:36:21.787
It's a self-care,
self-cure program.


01:36:22.110 --> 01:36:24.954
That we can have a
debate is important.


01:36:25.980 --> 01:36:28.859
That we can talk about this openly


01:36:29.984 --> 01:36:32.157
without being
threatened on either side.


01:36:33.454 --> 01:36:35.899
When we first heard
about Dr. Young,


01:36:35.923 --> 01:36:37.534
I looked him up on the internet


01:36:37.558 --> 01:36:41.405
and it made him
look like such a quack.


01:36:41.429 --> 01:36:44.508
I called my friend who had
initially turned me on to him


01:36:44.532 --> 01:36:46.877
to say, "What's up with this guy?"


01:36:46.901 --> 01:36:50.447
And he said, "Look, I
traveled with him for a year


01:36:50.471 --> 01:36:54.351
and watched a lot of
people, including my mother,


01:36:54.375 --> 01:36:57.821
heal from stage 4
metastasized cancer.


01:36:57.845 --> 01:36:59.790
You have to check him out."


01:36:59.814 --> 01:37:01.925
It's totally humbling to see


01:37:01.949 --> 01:37:04.962
how impactful it is
when slander is used


01:37:04.986 --> 01:37:07.231
to marginalize these breakthroughs.


01:37:07.255 --> 01:37:09.033
Even I fell into it


01:37:09.057 --> 01:37:11.401
and I've been slandered myself.


01:37:12.493 --> 01:37:15.873
So why and by whom


01:37:15.897 --> 01:37:18.175
are these innovations
being suppressed?


01:37:18.199 --> 01:37:21.211
Is this just random
bullying and corruption?


01:37:21.235 --> 01:37:22.846
According to our research,


01:37:22.870 --> 01:37:25.349
transformative breakthroughs
in every sector


01:37:25.373 --> 01:37:30.948
are being systematically stifled
in order to centralize authority.


01:37:31.546 --> 01:37:34.458
In our previous Thrive
film, we detailed our conclusion


01:37:34.482 --> 01:37:38.362
<i>that this suppression is the
result of a well-organized agenda</i>


01:37:38.386 --> 01:37:42.166
<i>that is carried out through systems
put in place at the highest levels</i>


01:37:42.190 --> 01:37:44.601
of banking, government,


01:37:44.625 --> 01:37:49.370
medicine, food,
energy and information.


01:37:51.232 --> 01:37:55.979
Our investigations confirm
that those seeking world domination,


01:37:56.003 --> 01:37:59.383
sometimes referred to
as the globalist cabal,


01:37:59.407 --> 01:38:03.287
have the goal to suppress
innovations in order to manipulate


01:38:03.311 --> 01:38:08.454
what we have, what we
know, and what we do.


01:38:09.617 --> 01:38:13.597
Their agenda is not a
thriving world for everyone,


01:38:13.621 --> 01:38:16.898
but global control by an elite few.


01:38:23.431 --> 01:38:27.177
In Thrive I, we presented
over 60 controversial facts


01:38:27.201 --> 01:38:30.180
detailing the structures
and the strategies


01:38:30.204 --> 01:38:32.980
by which this agenda for
control was being implemented.


01:38:33.508 --> 01:38:37.320
Not one of these facts has
been successfully disputed.


01:38:38.446 --> 01:38:42.659
The globalists' intent
is to take down America


01:38:42.683 --> 01:38:45.028
and any other powerful country


01:38:45.052 --> 01:38:47.364
in order to establish essentially


01:38:47.388 --> 01:38:51.598
a universal banking
corporation to rule the world.


01:38:52.460 --> 01:38:55.139
The agenda is playing
out like clockwork


01:38:55.163 --> 01:38:59.943
as we navigate the measures put in
place as a result of the coronavirus.


01:38:59.967 --> 01:39:03.981
Abiding by new government
mandates makes sense to most people


01:39:04.005 --> 01:39:06.316
to protect against the
spread of what we're told


01:39:06.340 --> 01:39:09.287
is an extremely contagious disease.


01:39:09.677 --> 01:39:15.392
But giving up rights has profound
consequences under any circumstances.


01:39:15.416 --> 01:39:17.694
In fact, claiming our rights


01:39:17.718 --> 01:39:22.332
is at the core of our ability to
get breakthrough innovations out,


01:39:22.356 --> 01:39:25.569
to create vibrant
local communities,


01:39:25.593 --> 01:39:28.972
and even to choose what
we do with our own bodies.


01:39:29.497 --> 01:39:31.642
How does someone get a right?


01:39:31.666 --> 01:39:33.077
Who gives it?


01:39:33.468 --> 01:39:35.513
Who takes it away?


01:39:35.536 --> 01:39:40.542
The question of rights really
revolves around the issue of authority.


01:39:41.142 --> 01:39:44.222
Authority means the right to rule,


01:39:44.245 --> 01:39:47.023
not just the ability
to control somebody,


01:39:47.048 --> 01:39:50.689
but the right to forcibly
dominate other people.


01:39:51.519 --> 01:39:55.032
So how does somebody
get this legal authority,


01:39:55.056 --> 01:39:56.262
this right?


01:40:02.763 --> 01:40:08.042
If I, as a single human being,
can't legally stop you


01:40:08.135 --> 01:40:12.115
from taking a medicine
that you believe will help you,


01:40:12.139 --> 01:40:17.588
then why and how does a government
official claim the right to do it?


01:40:17.612 --> 01:40:22.493
There's both a rational and
a moral incoherence here.


01:40:22.750 --> 01:40:26.129
If I don't have the moral
right to do a certain thing


01:40:26.153 --> 01:40:28.499
and my neighbor doesn't
have the right to do it either,


01:40:28.523 --> 01:40:31.168
how could we possibly
have given somebody else,


01:40:31.192 --> 01:40:33.403
government or anybody
else, the right to do it?


01:40:33.427 --> 01:40:35.139
Morality doesn't work that way.


01:40:35.162 --> 01:40:37.673
If it's wrong for me and him and
him and him and him and him,


01:40:37.698 --> 01:40:39.109
it's wrong for anybody,


01:40:39.133 --> 01:40:41.712
including government.
Even if they have constitutions,


01:40:41.736 --> 01:40:44.715
even if they have elections,
even if they call it legislation,


01:40:44.739 --> 01:40:46.083
it's still wrong.


01:40:46.107 --> 01:40:49.419
You can't make something bad into
something good by doing a bunch of


01:40:49.443 --> 01:40:53.056
weird pseudo-religious
rituals and calling it law.


01:40:53.080 --> 01:40:54.491
It's still wrong.


01:40:57.685 --> 01:41:02.732
The majority of people who
enable authoritarian injustice


01:41:02.757 --> 01:41:04.768
are not trying to be bad,


01:41:04.792 --> 01:41:07.437
but they've been taught to
believe that obedience is a virtue,


01:41:07.461 --> 01:41:09.406
that paying your
taxes is a good thing,


01:41:09.430 --> 01:41:11.475
that obeying the
law is a good thing.


01:41:11.499 --> 01:41:14.811
And so you get a bunch of
well-intentioned, decent people


01:41:14.835 --> 01:41:17.081
accidentally enabling evil,


01:41:17.104 --> 01:41:19.650
because ruling classes
don't pay for themselves.


01:41:19.674 --> 01:41:21.250
They don't fund themselves.


01:41:23.578 --> 01:41:26.622
You would never convince
people to reach in their pockets


01:41:26.647 --> 01:41:28.158
and come up with the money


01:41:28.182 --> 01:41:31.194
to go invade seven
countries in the Middle East.


01:41:31.218 --> 01:41:32.796
It would never happen


01:41:32.820 --> 01:41:37.167
without the notion of
centralized authority as a state,


01:41:37.191 --> 01:41:39.535
as an authoritarian government.


01:41:44.432 --> 01:41:47.443
We've got clean
ways to access energy,


01:41:47.468 --> 01:41:50.514
natural ways to
prevent and heal illness,


01:41:50.538 --> 01:41:54.350
and tools to accelerate our
expanding consciousness.


01:41:56.844 --> 01:41:58.388
And yet I believe


01:41:58.412 --> 01:42:01.458
unraveling this belief in authority


01:42:01.482 --> 01:42:05.128
holds the most important
key to our survival.


01:42:05.152 --> 01:42:08.599
The government and the
state is particularly challenging


01:42:08.623 --> 01:42:12.603
because it takes away the
interpersonal nature of violence,


01:42:12.627 --> 01:42:14.339
which is one of the
things that limits violence.


01:42:14.362 --> 01:42:18.105
So it's the outsourcing of violence,
which tends to make it escalate.


01:42:18.766 --> 01:42:20.510
Some people have


01:42:20.534 --> 01:42:23.447
the idea that if something
is legal, it's moral.


01:42:23.471 --> 01:42:27.578
All of the persecution of the
Jews in Nazi Germany were legal,


01:42:27.908 --> 01:42:31.879
but I think few people
would say that it was moral.


01:42:33.814 --> 01:42:35.225
That's what government does:


01:42:35.249 --> 01:42:39.262
It tries to make immoral moral


01:42:39.286 --> 01:42:42.460
by giving it the
blessing of legality.


01:42:48.562 --> 01:42:51.908
More than 200 million
people were killed


01:42:51.932 --> 01:42:53.910
just by their own governments,


01:42:53.934 --> 01:42:55.712
not even counting war,


01:42:55.736 --> 01:42:57.180
in the last hundred years.


01:42:57.204 --> 01:43:00.344
And obviously, that's not what
proponents of government want.


01:43:01.275 --> 01:43:03.620
There are two giant cons


01:43:03.644 --> 01:43:05.589
and if we understand these,


01:43:05.613 --> 01:43:08.592
we can understand the
predicament we're in


01:43:08.616 --> 01:43:10.527
and the way to get free.


01:43:11.318 --> 01:43:13.821
The first one is the
myth of authority.


01:43:14.689 --> 01:43:19.236
If you can convince people that
someone should be ruling over them,


01:43:19.260 --> 01:43:22.207
then all you have to do is
make sure you're the one.


01:43:23.431 --> 01:43:25.468
The second is money.


01:43:25.833 --> 01:43:29.646
Once you've secured the
authority to rule over others,


01:43:29.670 --> 01:43:31.782
then you can take
over the money system


01:43:31.806 --> 01:43:34.616
and manipulate it to
maintain your control.


01:43:35.309 --> 01:43:38.555
With the monopoly on force,
which governments have,


01:43:38.579 --> 01:43:42.392
and the ability to tax
and to print money,


01:43:42.416 --> 01:43:46.296
a small group can potentially
take over everything


01:43:46.320 --> 01:43:47.731
and everyone.


01:43:49.857 --> 01:43:51.469
Despite their rhetoric,


01:43:51.492 --> 01:43:54.503
governments always
look to expand their power


01:43:54.528 --> 01:43:57.908
and increase their
control until people revolt.


01:43:57.932 --> 01:44:01.645
And when a revolution brings
a new regime into power,


01:44:01.669 --> 01:44:06.283
it's not long until that regime
begins to expand that power


01:44:06.307 --> 01:44:09.286
until the cycle just
repeats all over again.


01:44:09.310 --> 01:44:14.760
Replace, expand, revolt, repeat.


01:44:14.982 --> 01:44:19.464
Across the globe, people
are frustrated and protesting,


01:44:19.487 --> 01:44:22.599
and they're frustrated
with protesting.


01:44:22.623 --> 01:44:23.933
From Occupy,


01:44:23.958 --> 01:44:25.470
the Yellow Vests,


01:44:25.493 --> 01:44:26.494
and Hong Kong


01:44:26.560 --> 01:44:30.273
to Venezuela, Brazil, China,


01:44:30.297 --> 01:44:33.835
Brexit, the United States
and countless others.


01:44:34.702 --> 01:44:37.581
What is the resolution
that's missing?


01:44:38.739 --> 01:44:43.019
We propose that it's to
reclaim individual sovereignty


01:44:43.043 --> 01:44:45.522
and create protective rules


01:44:45.546 --> 01:44:47.856
without any authoritarian rulers.


01:44:49.650 --> 01:44:54.429
We've come a long way from
the pharaohs, kings and dictators


01:44:54.889 --> 01:44:59.002
to the presidents, premiers
and prime ministers of today,


01:44:59.026 --> 01:45:01.336
but we're not there yet.


01:45:02.429 --> 01:45:05.709
Democracy, even if it were honest,


01:45:05.733 --> 01:45:09.613
is still majority-or mob rule.


01:45:10.571 --> 01:45:13.950
You still have up
to 49% dissatisfied.


01:45:15.042 --> 01:45:17.521
The one thing we haven't tried


01:45:17.545 --> 01:45:20.526
is true equality of opportunity


01:45:20.581 --> 01:45:22.859
based on Non-Aggression


01:45:22.883 --> 01:45:25.796
with everyone
accountable for their actions


01:45:25.820 --> 01:45:29.666
and no one authorized
to rule over anyone else.


01:45:30.491 --> 01:45:34.070
The idea of our being
accountable to moral rules


01:45:34.094 --> 01:45:35.739
instead of rulers


01:45:35.763 --> 01:45:38.004
has been brewing for a longtime.


01:45:38.899 --> 01:45:44.014
Epicurus, in the 300s
AD, called it natural justice.


01:45:44.038 --> 01:45:48.351
John Locke, in the
1680s, called it natural law,


01:45:48.375 --> 01:45:50.946
being all equal and independent.


01:45:51.512 --> 01:45:55.792
Herbert Spencer, in the
1850s, called it equal freedom.


01:45:55.816 --> 01:45:58.696
And Gandhi called it "Hind Swaraj",


01:45:58.719 --> 01:46:00.630
meaning self-governance.


01:46:01.455 --> 01:46:05.635
It's most commonly now referred
to as the Non-Aggression Principle,


01:46:05.659 --> 01:46:08.833
