02:19:06.672 --> 02:19:08.782
at the expense of individuals


02:19:08.807 --> 02:19:12.778
because protecting
itself is its primary job.


02:19:13.779 --> 02:19:16.392
The job of enlightened rules


02:19:16.415 --> 02:19:19.555
is to protect people
and the planet.


02:19:20.018 --> 02:19:24.032
The transition toward
a condition of true freedom


02:19:24.056 --> 02:19:29.070
and ultimately a
"rules-but-no-rulers, stateless society"


02:19:29.094 --> 02:19:31.406
is happening naturally


02:19:31.430 --> 02:19:33.603
and as fast as it is allowed.


02:19:44.543 --> 02:19:45.817
In the United States,


02:19:45.878 --> 02:19:48.890
already over 90% of civil cases


02:19:48.914 --> 02:19:52.527
are resolved through
alternative dispute mediation


02:19:52.551 --> 02:19:54.553
rather than the government courts.


02:19:55.520 --> 02:19:57.866
I was astounded and
encouraged to learn that


02:19:57.890 --> 02:20:01.064
there are already more
independent peacekeepers


02:20:01.126 --> 02:20:04.505
in malls, corporations, hotels,


02:20:04.529 --> 02:20:06.574
schools and communities


02:20:06.598 --> 02:20:09.410
than there are government police.


02:20:09.434 --> 02:20:10.979
Not only do the rest of us


02:20:11.003 --> 02:20:15.583
vastly outnumber the perpetrators
of the global domination agenda


02:20:15.607 --> 02:20:18.019
by more than a million to one,


02:20:18.043 --> 02:20:22.458
but the Unified Field
itself is on our side.


02:20:22.748 --> 02:20:28.463
Truth, reason, virtue, compassion.


02:20:28.487 --> 02:20:30.798
These are the real-life superpowers


02:20:30.822 --> 02:20:34.135
that emerge when
you align with the Field.


02:20:34.159 --> 02:20:38.072
On the other hand, those who
would want to control or destroy us,


02:20:38.096 --> 02:20:41.942
they're trying to go up
against the entire Unified Field.


02:20:42.768 --> 02:20:46.716
Principles, not
politics, are the way out.


02:20:48.106 --> 02:20:50.652
The existence of a Field,
our relationship to the Field,


02:20:50.676 --> 02:20:53.488
the ability to tap the
potential of the Field,


02:20:53.512 --> 02:20:55.523
is what gives us the
evolutionary edge


02:20:55.547 --> 02:20:57.492
that our ancestors never had.


02:20:57.516 --> 02:21:00.595
The edge to not only
survive but to thrive


02:21:00.619 --> 02:21:02.964
in the existence of the
new world that's emerging,


02:21:02.988 --> 02:21:05.633
the new world that
you and I are designing


02:21:05.657 --> 02:21:08.001
because now we
know about the Field.


02:21:10.829 --> 02:21:13.775
There are big, systemic
changes needed


02:21:13.799 --> 02:21:16.945
and it's easy to
wonder, "How to begin?"


02:21:16.969 --> 02:21:20.178
I think the place to begin
anything is with ourselves.


02:21:20.839 --> 02:21:23.952
Like the vast consciousness
we exist within,


02:21:23.976 --> 02:21:25.978
it starts with purpose.


02:21:26.912 --> 02:21:29.090
Our Sector Solutions Wheel


02:21:29.114 --> 02:21:31.651
covers every area
of human endeavor.


02:21:32.250 --> 02:21:34.996
So, once you have
found your purpose


02:21:35.020 --> 02:21:37.832
and the Sector you
are most drawn to,


02:21:37.856 --> 02:21:40.234
then look at issues in that area


02:21:40.258 --> 02:21:44.638
to identify which one best
matches your skills and passion.


02:21:45.530 --> 02:21:50.878
Next, consider which level of
engagement best suits you right now.


02:21:50.902 --> 02:21:53.246
Is it working to meet
immediate needs,


02:21:53.772 --> 02:21:56.514
like helping someone
who's hungry to get food,


02:21:56.875 --> 02:21:58.720
improving systems,


02:21:58.744 --> 02:22:02.954
like helping to create easier access
to a broad range of health treatments.


02:22:03.281 --> 02:22:05.860
Or is it shifting consciousness,


02:22:05.884 --> 02:22:08.129
helping to refine the worldview


02:22:08.153 --> 02:22:10.064
that is at the root of them all?


02:22:10.922 --> 02:22:13.167
Aligning with the Unified Field


02:22:13.191 --> 02:22:15.970
can lead to an
experience of resonance


02:22:15.994 --> 02:22:17.564
that we call love.


02:22:18.163 --> 02:22:22.210
Not a romantic crush
kind of love, but the big love-


02:22:22.234 --> 02:22:25.704
Coming into harmony
with the life force itself.


02:22:26.772 --> 02:22:28.950
Applying reason and practice


02:22:28.974 --> 02:22:31.252
to unleashing our spiritual essence


02:22:31.276 --> 02:22:33.722
is what I call the Science of Love.


02:22:34.112 --> 02:22:38.926
A finite set of skills to
access this state of harmony.


02:22:38.950 --> 02:22:41.129
These skills are physical,


02:22:41.153 --> 02:22:46.267
emotional, mental,
and interpersonal.


02:22:46.291 --> 02:22:49.704
And it's possible to get
good enough at each of them


02:22:49.761 --> 02:22:53.607
to experience a deeply
fulfilling and effective life.


02:22:54.199 --> 02:22:58.046
I believe these skills
are not only obtainable,


02:22:58.070 --> 02:23:03.584
but in fact, evolving new abilities
is ordained in our evolutionary code.


02:23:05.811 --> 02:23:07.889
So what does it take?


02:23:07.913 --> 02:23:09.824
A clear destination,


02:23:10.949 --> 02:23:12.121
freedom,


02:23:12.918 --> 02:23:14.761
a map of how to get there,


02:23:16.221 --> 02:23:18.030
the Arc of Process,


02:23:20.592 --> 02:23:21.900
a compass,


02:23:22.928 --> 02:23:24.805
the Non-Aggression Principle,


02:23:26.064 --> 02:23:27.907
and a strategy.


02:23:29.701 --> 02:23:35.845
Restoring wholeness to natural
systems aligning with the Field.


02:23:38.944 --> 02:23:41.322
We were born to do this.


02:23:41.346 --> 02:23:43.690
We were born to thrive.


02:23:44.316 --> 02:23:48.129
The same way there's no
magic pill that can cure us


02:23:48.153 --> 02:23:51.065
if we don't deal
with our lifestyle,


02:23:51.089 --> 02:23:54.735
I don't believe there's
any one person or group,


02:23:54.759 --> 02:23:57.338
let alone some Marvel superhero,


02:23:57.362 --> 02:23:59.740
who can solve all our problems.


02:23:59.764 --> 02:24:03.234
I just don't think we can
outsource that capacity.


02:24:03.902 --> 02:24:05.313
So what it means


02:24:05.337 --> 02:24:09.817
is that we're all in charge of
coming up with this stuff ourselves.


02:24:09.841 --> 02:24:12.153
And as daunting as that can feel,


02:24:12.177 --> 02:24:14.680
it's actually good news.


02:24:14.913 --> 02:24:17.225
Because if it weren't up to us,


02:24:17.249 --> 02:24:18.926
we'd be powerless.


02:24:18.950 --> 02:24:20.759
And we're not.


02:24:20.986 --> 02:24:25.332
We are as powerful as
we allow ourselves to be.


02:24:26.057 --> 02:24:28.636
We're not alone in this.


02:24:28.660 --> 02:24:30.972
We are profoundly connected.


02:24:30.996 --> 02:24:34.637
Science and spirit
both show that now.


02:24:35.133 --> 02:24:38.112
And as the poet Rumi reminds us,


02:24:38.136 --> 02:24:42.380
Remember, you're not
just a drop in the ocean.


02:24:42.440 --> 02:24:45.853
You're the ocean in a drop."

